# 行尾策略: 全仓 LF (WIN 端接管前置, PRODUCTION_ROADMAP §8.3-5 / R8)
# WIN 端 clone 后 git config core.autocrlf false 配合本文件生效。

* text=auto
*.c  text eol=lf
*.h  text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.map text eol=lf
*.ini text eol=lf

# 二进制/不可文本化的保持原样
*.exe binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.bundle binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary